    "name": "Transfusion",
    "steam_appid": 2397910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a prisoner far from home, you must earn your freedom in the Arena slaying lizard-like creatures called Lacerites. Utilize the gifts of bloodthirsty gods to gain the edge in combat as you tear through wave after wave to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLASH, STAB, AND SEVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butcher hordes of Lacerites in gladiatorial combat with a variety of weapons from ancient Roman and Aztec cultures. Weaken enemies with your weapons to <i>break</i> them both in body and spirit. Dismember opponents limb by limb until you\u2019re the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of weapons to smear Lacerites onto the arena floor. Sprout a tree from a spear, bash a skull with a super-sized macuahuitl, and wield the abilities of the gods with unique weapons specialized to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/59123e6b65317d3a78d20a5268d79922.avif?t=1736787618\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE RIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfusion is an early access title and a passion project for our small dev team. If you enjoy our game, and want to help determine its future, please join our discord, help grow our community, and shape the game we have been working on. FOR THERE BE BLOOD</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/5826a846765e4f7bd52dbc7b3902e40c.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a prisoner far from home, you must earn your freedom in the Arena slaying lizard-like creatures called Lacerites. Utilize the gifts of bloodthirsty gods to gain the edge in combat as you tear through wave after wave to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/ee9d0983bdec296b8d526fe5b4c8ffe1.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLASH, STAB, AND SEVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butcher hordes of Lacerites in gladiatorial combat with a variety of weapons from ancient Roman and Aztec cultures. Weaken enemies with your weapons to <i>break</i> them both in body and spirit. Dismember opponents limb by limb until you\u2019re the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.poster.avif?t=1736787618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.webm?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.mp4?t=1736787618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of weapons to smear Lacerites onto the arena floor. Sprout a tree from a spear, bash a skull with a super-sized macuahuitl, and wield the abilities of the gods with unique weapons specialized to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/59123e6b65317d3a78d20a5268d79922.avif?t=1736787618\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE RIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfusion is an early access title and a passion project for our small dev team. If you enjoy our game, and want to help determine its future, please join our discord, help grow our community, and shape the game we have been working on. FOR THERE BE BLOOD</p>",
    "short_description": "Slice enemies into tiny pieces and wield the power of blood magic to survive another day in this fast-paced VR hack and slash!",
